data/pending_review/
!data/pending_review/.gitkeep
data/archive/
# Real PII (name/phone/email in every Resume.md header) — found missing 2026-07-20 by an audit
# specifically checking for this; was untracked but not yet ignored, one `git add -A` away from
# committing real candidate data, directly violating CLAUDE.md's own PII rule.
data/authored_drafts/
# CR-074 local before/after fixtures (Resume/CL headers carry real contact chrome) — keep on disk,
# never commit. Same PII class as authored_drafts / submissions.
data/context_pack_validation/
# Batch/Stage0/packet-eval run dumps. Already-tracked files under data/reports/ stay tracked;
# new dated dumps stay local (Layer D hygiene, 2026-08-12).
data/reports/
pipeline-log.md
pipeline_log.txt

# Materialized from SQLite - source of truth is the Job Search settings UI
data/candidate_preferences.json

